flowchart TD
 A([Start])-->B[Load route and fare catalog]
 B-->C{Catalog available?}
 C--No-->E[Show unavailable message]-->Z([End])
 C--Yes-->D[Select destination and ticket quantity]
 D-->F[Review total and choose payment]
 F-->G{Method}
 G--Card-->H[Request secure terminal authorization]
 G--QR wallet-->I[Create order and display QR with expiry]
 H-->J{Final status?}
 I-->K[Wait for signed callback or status query]
 K-->J
 J--Approved / Paid-->L[Persist paid order idempotently]
 L-->M[Create barcode ticket and print]
 M-->N{Print succeeded?}
 N--Yes-->O[Show success and receipt]-->Z
 N--No-->P[Record ticket pending; show recovery and alert operator]-->Z
 J--Declined / expired-->Q[Show reason; offer retry or cancel]-->Z
 J--Unknown / timeout-->R[Keep pending and reconcile; do not issue ticket]-->Z